  "rationale": "The national split is not materially overstated. Indonesian ponsel pintar and Malaysian Malay telefon pintar are distinct, established localized terms, while smartphone is also an accepted shared borrowing/synonym in both varieties. This supports a useful preference contrast rather than invalidating the different-common-word relation. The English cue and sense are accurate. No false-friend contrast is indicated or required for these forms.",
