        "https://dictionary.cambridge.org/dictionary/english/smartphone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "Indonesian answer: ponsel pintar",
      "conclusion": "Supported as an ordinary Indonesian term for smartphone; Indonesian government usage explicitly pairs ponsel pintar with smartphone.",
